### Start a temporary-file benchmark (writes and removes /PFTEST.BIN)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/self-test
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"start","size_mib":32}

### Cancel and clean up the benchmark
POST http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/self-test
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"cancel"}

### Read benchmark progress and average speeds
GET http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/status

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8766

### Get current device state (200, including connected=false when no board is attached)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/status

### OpenAPI description in Development
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json